                <mxCell id="asmd-revised-detail-note" value="ASMD interpretation: these two paths are not alternate FSM states. Their conditional register updates are evaluated on the same RUN cycle. The main FSM checks compute_done &amp;&amp; load_done using their pre-edge values, so a newly asserted done flag is observed for transition on a later clock edge." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=15;fontColor=#253041;" vertex="1" parent="1">
